## Why This Is Asked

Assesses practical Dataflow design for multi-table ingestion, basic validation, and idempotent writes in a beginner context. Includes fault handling (DLQ) and a rollback strategy to backfill.

## Key Concepts

- Dataflow (Beam) fundamentals
- Pub/Sub ingestion and DLQ routing
- BigQuery daily partitions and separate schemas
- Idempotent writes with insertId
- Simple schema evolution and archival

